#: environments/atmospheric_1928.env.json
msgid "A picture palace built as a courtyard under a twilight sky: lit windows, iron balconies, cypresses over the walls and real stars."
msgstr ""

#: environments/bathysphere.env.json
msgid "A glass dome on the sea floor: fish drift past, glowing creatures come to the screen, and now and then a whale passes in a quiet scene."
msgstr ""

#: environments/cinema.env.json
msgid "The converted cinema: rows on a rake, curtains that part when the film starts, and the house lights going down."
msgstr ""

#: environments/crater.env.json
msgid "An amphitheatre on the Moon under a glass dome: Earth turns slowly over the film, and the Milky Way comes out when the lights go down."
msgstr ""

